flowchart TD
    SUB["submit with key K"] --> RESP{response?}
    RESP -->|success| MARK["mark complete, discard K"]
    RESP -->|lost/timeout| RETRY["retry SAME key K"]
    RETRY --> SEEN{server seen K?}
    SEEN -->|yes| STORED["return stored result"]
    SEEN -->|no| EXEC["execute once"]
    STORED --> MARK
    EXEC --> MARK
